Absolutly not. You look on the Medusa, not the Medusa looks on you.
I know 3 ways. Blindness, stealth (she will not wake up then) and level
change.

Blindness:
Blindfold,
Potion of blindness,
Expensive camera,
Wand of lightning (this will cost you some hitpoints!) or blue dragon,
yellow light or dust vortex.

Stealth:
Elven cloak,
Elven boats,
Intrinsic (Valkyrie, Elf etc.),
Ring of stealth,
Gods (pray for it).

Level change:
Cursed potion of gain level,
and all level teleports.

Are there others ways to pass the Medusa in the wrong direction?

